                "text": "Thank you @POTUS for prioritizing & protecting the Great Lakes! It\u2019s time for @GovPritzker to stop playing political games and make the Great Lakes a priority! \n\nOur economic health in Michigan is directly tied to the ecological health of the Great Lakes!\n\nAs co-chair of the House Great Lakes Task Force, I will continue to work to strengthen the Great Lakes and make these incredible resources a national priority!",
